":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","number":23,"title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":3,"created_at":"2025-07-21T16:01:44Z","updated_at":"2026-01-25T09:35:03Z","closed_at":"2025-09-30T16:26:18Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108836","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108836","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108836.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108836.patch","merged_at":"2025-09-30T16:26:18Z"},"body":"The JSON specification supports scientific notation for numbers. https://www.json.org/json-en.html\r\n\r\nThis PR changes the behavior of the JSON stringify function so that when the `p_full_precision` flag is true, it uses `num_scientific`, and therefore the Grisu2 algorithm introduced in PR #98750.\r\n\r\nThere has been a bug for awhile where glTF files exported from Godot are reported as invalid by the glTF validator because the accessor min and max values do not match the data in the accessor:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1200\" height=\"238\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-07-21 at 7 04 00 AM\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/873aa8f0-b965-4924-ad88-e059f8358779\" />\r\n\r\nI've known about this bug for years, but it hasn't been a priority. I decided to solve it, and turns out, it's not a bug with the glTF exporter, it's a bug with Godot's JSON stringify function. This PR fixes that function, and also adjusts the glTF code to set `p_full_precision` to true. With this PR, the exported glTF file passes validation:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1200\" height=\"231\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-07-21 at 8 53 26 AM\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f76ef057-fa81-4ab9-a05a-b3126099c7e4\" />\r\n\r\nAlso: In most cases, this approach can be way more efficient. `1.7976931348623157e+308` is much shorter than `.0`\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108836/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108836/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}